Subject: [PATCH 21/40] audit(core-compiler): independent oracle +
 differential/metamorphic/mutant test suite

Independent Python reference interpreter of the designer semantics written
from README decisions 1-8, FORMAT.md and HOST.md (not from Chart.lean), with
explicit switches for the ambiguities of the prose. Tests against the real
figram-engine: directed table-driven cases with hand-written expectations,
random documents with branch-exhaustive cases, random event sequences with
stale/forged tokens, stale snapshots and document upgrades, metamorphic
checks, acceptance differential of check, lint-gap and scale probes, a
shrinker and red-proofs (broken oracle variants, engine mutants).

(cherry picked from commit 79189086ca30bfb92ecb588a4554cb5c188b7cb6)

